## Taskbar Module - Commercial License Required

The following components are excluded from the open source license above and
are subject to a separate commercial license:

- The files `src/taskbar-pin.c` and `src/taskbar.c`, in whole or in part
- Any work derived from them, in any programming language, including code
  that reproduces the way they pin programs to the taskbar, change its pins
  or control its buttons and icons

Collectively referred to as the "Taskbar Module."

All other files of the Software are under the open source license above,
including the code that works alongside the Taskbar Module: shortcuts and
their AppUserModelIDs (`src/shortcuts.c`), the profile icons and badges
(`src/icons.c`), the notification-area icon (`src/tray.c`) and the manager
window (`src/gui.c`).

